				<r3d:description language="eng">figshare is the RDM system at the University. It is a cloud-based data repository that supports multiple file formats. Research data in the form of datasets, code, audio, images and more can be disseminated via the University&#039;s figshare. Citations can be traced for datasets (not just the final research output/article) and analytics will show who is looking at our research data around the world.
figshare enables researchers to store research data in a secure way. The system is user-friendly, with easy access, and shareable with colleagues and collaborators on research projects. Where appropriate it enables researchers to make research data openly accessible.</r3d:description>
